  "description": {
    "en": "The SNB's own read of the business cycle, distilled from its quarterly talks with companies across Switzerland. Twenty-four qualitative signals: turnover, capacity utilisation, procurement difficulties, margins, lending conditions, liquidity, staff shortages, expected turnover and employment, expected price changes, investment plans, and firms' wage and inflation expectations. Most are diffusion indices; the wage and inflation expectations are in percent."
  },
